{"id":"n15207-2-7","stage":3,"title":"여럿 · 大家","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15207-2-7-1","ko":"우리랑 같이 공부할래?","zh":"要和我们一起学习吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리랑","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부할래?","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/330838ddefb9bf6a3e3f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15207-2-7-2","ko":"그냥 혼자 할게. 나는 여럿이서 공부를 하면 공부가 잘 안 돼서.","zh":"我还是自己学吧。人多了一起学，我就学不进去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그냥","meaning":"随便","explanation":"그냥：随便","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"4","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할게.","meaning":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여럿이서","meaning":"大家，许多人","explanation":"여럿：大家，许多人；이서：接在人数表达后，表示这些人共同参与动作。","readings":[{"term":"여럿","audio":"/audio/4bd2b4778a4cf299cd75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15207","senseId":"2","lemma":"여럿","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하면","meaning":"表示理由或依据。","explanation":"하다：表示理由或依据。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"8","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부가","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼서.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"随便","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"没有任何想法或别意地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。；表示理由或依据。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4bd2b4778a4cf299","term":"여럿","zh":"大家，许多人","audio":"/audio/4bd2b4778a4cf299cd75.mp3","entryId":"15207","definition":"很多人。","pronunciation":["여럳"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/47352680a3778730dd1b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.153,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15207","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"http